FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.27.4-trixie@sha256:f18c3d73a184fb0582828510722e723b63a93f7188d11dd223d9be6f6880e65d AS build

ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH
ARG VERSION=dev

WORKDIR /src
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN --mount=type=cache,target=/go/pkg/mod \
    go mod download

COPY api/ api/
COPY cmd/ cmd/
COPY internal/ internal/
RUN --mount=type=cache,target=/go/pkg/mod \
    --mount=type=cache,target=/root/.cache/go-build \
    CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=$TARGETOS GOARCH=$TARGETARCH \
    go build -trimpath \
      -ldflags "-s -w -X github.com/gabrosys/plugin-telemetry/internal/version.Version=${VERSION}" \
      -o /out/plugin-telemetry ./cmd/plugin-telemetry

FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian13:nonroot@sha256:aafe993665bf6200db38a02c11a9351e782a84b6a45e7f33b6695638c88e3931

COPY --from=build /out/plugin-telemetry /plugin-telemetry
USER 65532:65532
ENTRYPOINT ["/plugin-telemetry"]
